- Data: the project's data lives in {{.Data.Root}} (each worktree has a `data` symlink to it).
{{- if .Data.Inputs}} Inputs ({{join .Data.Inputs ", "}}) are read-only.{{end}}
{{- if .Data.Sealed}} Sealed directories ({{join .Data.Sealed ", "}}) cannot be changed; ask the user to unseal one if needed.{{end}}
{{- if .Data.Work}} Put new results in {{join .Data.Work ", "}}.{{else}} Put new results outside the input and sealed directories.{{end}}
